%% A GraphQL request, end to end
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Page component
    participant H as useXxx hook
    participant Z as zustand store<br/>24h TTL
    participant A as Apollo Client<br/>InMemoryCache
    participant S as Apollo Server<br/>:4000
    participant R as Resolver
    participant L as DataLoader
    participant Q as SQL query module
    participant D as better-sqlite3<br/>readonly

    P->>H: filters, pagination
    H->>Z: getCachedData(queryName + params)
    alt fresh entry under 24h
        Z-->>H: cached rows
        Note over H,A: query is skipped entirely
    else miss or stale
        H->>A: useQuery, network-only
        A->>S: POST /, operation + variables
        S->>S: context() builds 17 fresh<br/>DataLoaders for this request
        S->>R: resolve root field
        R->>Q: getPortfolioKPIs(filters)
        Q->>Q: build SQL, add a JOIN only<br/>when a filter needs it
        Q->>D: prepare(sql).all(params)
        D-->>Q: rows
        Q-->>R: rows
        loop each nested field
            R->>L: load(key)
            L->>D: one SELECT ... WHERE key IN (?, ?, ...)
            D-->>L: rows
            L-->>R: per-key result
        end
        R-->>S: data
        S-->>A: JSON
        A-->>H: data
        H->>Z: setCachedData(key, data, now)
    end
    H-->>P: rows for the chart or table
